    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>节目介绍</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>大家好，这里是疯狂姐妹花</span></strong><span>👭</span><strong><span>的第二十五期</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我们是一对从小一起欢笑打闹的</span></strong><span>00</span><strong><span>后表姐妹；</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我们是两个渴望有钱有闲有时间的女大学生；</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我们是一直探索未来多种可能性的中国女人！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>创业的一个月</span></p><span></span><p><span>难道结局就应该是失败了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>那难道成功了</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们就会跟大家去分享成功经验</span></p><span></span><p><span>失败</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们就会开始去抱怨时代</span></p><span></span><p><span>好像不管哪两种结局</span></p><span></span><p><span>对于这些播客的分享来说</span></p><span></span><p><span>都没有必要</span></p><span></span><p><span>曾经我们以为引以为傲的经验</span></p><span></span><p><span>现在也发生了翻天覆地的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span>折磨的不仅仅是身体</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多的是心态</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期跟大家真实真诚</span></p><span></span><p><span>分享我们的创业故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>#时间戳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a>折磨的创业故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">04:50</a>创业根本没法有经验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="593">09:53</a> 网络被妖魔化的创业故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a>我们习惯的创业故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="969">16:09</a>创业的综合能力要求很高！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1284">21:24</a> 每代人都有自己爱的成功学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1631">27:11</a>很可靠的“创业伙伴”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a>温州遍地都是老板“吗”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2420">40:20</a>下一期的创业综艺怎么编</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播介绍</span></p><span><